  "details": "- CVE-2026-34978: reject \"..\" path traversal in the RSS notifier\n  notify-recipient-uri, both in notifier/rss.c and when the subscription\n  is created in the scheduler, and refuse to write when the target path\n  exists and is not a regular file; previously a remote IPP client could\n  make the lp-owned notifier clobber root-managed state such as\n  CacheDir/job.cache\n- CVE-2026-34979: fix heap buffer overflow when building filter option\n  strings; ipp_length() skipped NOVALUE, MIMETYPE, NAMELANG, TEXTLANG,\n  URI and URISCHEME attributes that get_options() does emit, so the\n  allocated options buffer was undersized",
